Some potions start out with a small probability of containing a genie, who
might give you a wish.  Your healer starts with four copies of two types 
of potions, and if one of them is the right kind, you have a head start in
the race to get that first wish.

Of course, if the potion was blessed, it makes it more likely that the genie
will give you the wish, rather than start beating you up.  But healers also
have a natural advantage when they want to bless something.

